   "q": "What is $i^3$?",
   "type": "single",
   "options": [
    "$-1$",
    "$1$",
    "$i$",
    "$-i$"
   ],
   "correct": 3,
   "why": {
    "correct": "Powers of $i$ cycle: $i^1 = i$, $i^2 = -1$, $i^3 = -i$, $i^4 = 1$.",
    "options": [
     "$-1$ is $i^2$; multiply by one more $i$.",
     "$i^4 = 1$; $i^3$ is one factor of $i$ short.",
     "$i^1 = i$ and $i^5 = i$, but $i^3 = i^2 \\cdot i$.",
     "Right: $i^3 = i^2 \\cdot i = -1 \\cdot i = -i$."
